WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.936
Divide hundreds, then tens, then ones. Check every answer by multiplication.

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:14.509
Calculate 336 divided by 6. The answer is 56. 6 times 56 equals 336.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:21.150
A club during a reading competition shares 531 pencils equally among 9 teams. How

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.455
many per team? Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:32.153
A club during a reading competition shares 531 pencils equally among 9 teams. How

00:00:32.153 --> 00:00:38.041
many per team? The answer is 59. 9 times 59 equals 531.
